@startuml state-diagram
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F4EF
  BorderColor #1D7A5C
  BackgroundColor<<final>> #F2F2F0
  BorderColor<<final>> #6B6B66
}
hide empty description
state "Running" as Running
state Pausing
state Paused
state Cancelling
state Cancelled <<final>>
state Done <<final>>
state Failed <<final>>

[*] --> Running : request
Running -down-> Pausing : pause
Pausing -down-> Paused : recorded
Paused -left-> Running : resume
Running -up-> Done : complete
Running -right-> Failed : fail
Running -left-> Cancelling : cancel
Pausing -left-> Cancelling : cancel
Paused -left-> Cancelling : cancel
Cancelling -down-> Cancelled : recorded

legend bottom
  Running groups Working, AwaitingClarification,
  AwaitingApproval, and Executing. See the transition table.
  Active includes Running, Pausing, Paused, and Cancelling.
  Stop, disconnection, or provider failure pauses work.
  Pause and cancellation block new task actions.
  Resumption requires user intent and a state check.
  Paused work does not resume on reconnection alone.
  Earlier external operations may settle after a pause.
endlegend
@enduml
